of_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_K\">\\(c_K\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ObeysCost}\">\\(\\mathrm{ObeysCost}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f0c7d6fbe9cca58a\" href=\"?note=f0c7d6fbe9cca58a\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial-cost\">43-df-ktrivial-cost</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad966749904b15ec\" href=\"?note=ad966749904b15ec\" title=\"43-df-obeys-cost\">43-df-obeys-cost</a>；K 平凡性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{ObeysCost}(A,c_K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{ObeysCost}(A,c_K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书把总量归一化为小于 1/2；这里用有限总量，缩放机器开销可吸收不同常数。逐项比对陈述，未重建反向近似构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial-cost","status":"resolved","id":"f0c7d6fbe9cca58a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial-cost]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-obeys-cost","status":"resolved","id":"ad966749904b15ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","loca